<Layout title="Join us"><section class="page-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">WORK WITH THE ANG LAB</p><h1>Join us</h1><p>We're interested in connecting with curious scientists and collaborators who share our enthusiasm for insect biology.</p></section><section class="section-space wrap editorial-two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">OPPORTUNITIES</p><h2>People make discoveries possible.</h2></div><div><p>We welcome enquiries from prospective PhD students, postdoctoral researchers and collaborators. Availability of specific funded positions varies, so please check for advertised vacancies.</p><p>Explore the University of York for further information about study and research opportunities.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.york.ac.uk/biology/">University of York Biology ↗</a></div></section></Layout>
